OL,3,GNEWSA'Better than computer games' -
OL,4,Ashould chess become a sport after
OL,5,Apopularity boom?
OL,6,
OL,7,FChess fans are aiming to get the game
OL,8,Fformally recognised as a sport in the
OL,9,FUK after a surge in global popularity
OL,10,Fand among sporting stars.
OL,12,FWhile over 100 countries and the
OL,13,FInternational Olympic Committee
OL,14,Fofficially classify chess as a sport,
OL,15,Fit is still not recognised in the UK
OL,16,Fand Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
