OL,3,GNEWSA'Better than computer games' -
OL,4,Ashould chess become a sport after
OL,5,Apopularity boom?
OL,6,
OL,7,FChess coaches Tim and Sarah Kett, from
OL,8,FCardiff, are part of a group of people
OL,9,Fhoping a Welsh Parliament consultation
OL,10,Fon sport will help get the ball
OL,11,Frolling, calling chess the "antidote to
OL,12,Fvideo games".
OL,14,FExperts have even said the chess "boom"
OL,15,Fis building young minds and the market
OL,16,Fis expected to grow to $7.66bn (#5.7bn)
OL,17,Fby 2034, according to Fortune Business
OL,18,FInsights.
